1837 9B1E             (       circle.asm):00262                         ADDA    <F_PL           ;  one after) to the last (or the
1839 9721             (       circle.asm):00263                         STA     <F_RS           ;  one before)
183B 961D             (       circle.asm):00264                         LDA     <F_CX1
