184D 9A26             (       circle.asm):00274                         ORA     <F_MR
184F D622             (       circle.asm):00275                         LDB     <F_RN
1851 17FE2A           (       circle.asm):00276                         LBSR    FILLSEG
1854 3510             (       circle.asm):00277                         PULS    X
