1BD6 2716             (       CW_ROWBITS):00002                         BEQ     CR0_N
1BD8 9138             (       CW_ROWBITS):00003                         CMPA    <S_A+0         ; left pixel within it?
1BDA 2506             (       CW_ROWBITS):00004                         BLO     CR0_R
